+# Copyright (c) 2025, Tri Dao.
+# Copyright (c) 2026, Jerry Chen
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 AND MIT
+# Modifications Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
